      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This book is not written to guide you. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 82
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is written to make you notice what you are already doing inside your mind. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 83
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It does not claim to heal, fix, or improve anything. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 84
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It only observes how emotional experience is built — through repetition, "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 85
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "interpretation, and silent reinforcement of thought loops. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 86
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "If at any point this feels personal… "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 87
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "it is not because the book is speaking about you. "
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 88
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is because the mind recognizes its own structure."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 89
    }
